      "message": "Merge main into issue/1186-tool-refusal-names (tools.rs is_sane: port the Wire rules into tool_sanity.rs)\n\nMain (#2011) added ToolKind::Wire with two rules in the old inline\nis_sane body. This branch moved the law to tool_sanity.rs. Keep the\nbranch's structure and port both rules: Wire is a no-spindle kind, and\nits kind arm returns wire::refusal. The oracle test holds main's lines,\nKINDS grows to 18, and two new pins cover a bad and a valid wire.\n\nRefs #1186\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
